// ARDUINO MEGA - 4WD NORMAL WHEEL (SKID-STEER) CONTROLLER
// Version: 4.6 - Zero-Lag High-Speed Navigation & Diagnostics
// ======================================================
// Modes (from ESP8266 on Serial1, Pin 19 @ 115200):
//   Manual      : F, B, L, R, Q, E, q, e, S, M
//   Ultrasonic  : A (5x HC-SR04 autonomous)
//   2D LiDAR    : D (RPi 4B RPLiDAR autonomous)
//   Dual Fusion : H (RPi 4B RPLiDAR + 5x HC-SR04 ground shield)
//   Test / Diag : T (Sensor health, live telemetry stream, motors stopped)
//
// Telemetry Output (to ESP8266 on Serial1 Pin 18 TX1 via 10k/20k divider):
//   Format: "U:fc,fl,fr,l,r,healthy_count,rpi_ok,lidar_ok,mode\n"
//
// 20x4 I2C LCD (SDA -> Pin 20, SCL -> Pin 21):
//   Row 0: [ROVER] <MODE>
//   Row 1: ESP: OK/WAIT | RPi: OK/WAIT
//   Row 2: US: 5/5 OK   | LDR: OK/WAIT
//   Row 3: Live distance metrics or action telemetry
// ======================================================

